        type: "paragraph",
        text: "A brief, proactive check-in, even a short email confirming there's nothing new to report, often prevents the anxious call that would otherwise come in a day later. Firms that build this kind of light-touch, scheduled communication into how they manage every case, not just the ones that have already become difficult, tend to see fewer clients escalate to that point in the first place.",
